  "id": "creamy-coconut-milk-rice-pudding",
  "name": "Creamy Coconut Milk Rice Pudding",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced rice pudding with coconut, peaches, and raisins.",
  "description": "Tender basmati rice cooks with coconut milk and dairy, then is finished with egg, butter, warm spices, peaches, and raisins for a rich dessert.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
